%
(DMC2 SCRIPT 1)
(DMC2 EFFECTS axis-motion;digital-output;coordinate-state;external-command)
(DMC2 REQUIRES running-session;estop-clear;machine-on;interpreter-idle;all-homed)
(DMC2 RECOVERY abort-task)
(DMC2 END)
(Automatic top map: connected coverage, growing brackets and cell-centre checks.)
(Every dip returns to original starting Z. Plate-censored space remains unknown.)
(Physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
o<stock-surface-preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    M2
o<stock-surface-preview> endif
o<stock-surface-valid> if [#<_hal[axisui.stock-surface-parameters-valid]> NE 1]
    (ABORT,Enter the Automatic top map settings in Scripts before Run. Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<stock-surface-valid> endif
#<arg0> = [3]
#<arg1> = [#<_hal[axisui.stock-surface-drop-mm]>]
#<arg2> = [#<_hal[axisui.stock-surface-grid-mm]>]
#<arg3> = [#<_hal[axisui.stock-surface-resolution-mm]>]
#<arg4> = [#<_hal[axisui.stock-surface-usable-reach-mm]>]
#<arg5> = [#<_hal[axisui.stock-surface-reach-reserve-mm]>]
#<arg6> = [0]
#<arg7> = [0]
(The legacy side-depth and side-backoff arguments are unused in top mode.)
(X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
o<mapper-run> call [#<arg0>] [#<arg1>] [#<arg2>] [#<arg3>] [#<arg4>] [#<arg5>] [#<arg6>] [#<arg7>]
M2
%
